{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23931","headline":"予与微之老而无子发於言叹着在诗篇今年冬各有一子戏作二什一以相贺一以自嘲 一 · 白居易","name":"予与微之老而无子发於言叹着在诗篇今年冬各有一子戏作二什一以相贺一以自嘲 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"常忧到老都无子，何况新生又是儿。\n阴德自然宜有庆，皇天可得道无知。\n一园水竹今爲主，百卷文章更付谁。\n莫虑鵷鶵无浴处，即应重入凤皇池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23931.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23931","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}